{
  "id": "as-coordgeo",
  "chapterNumber": "4",
  "title": {
    "en": "Coordinate Geometry",
    "ar": null
  },
  "chapterTag": {
    "variant": "category",
    "className": "as-tag",
    "badgeClassName": "as-paper",
    "emoji": "📌",
    "category": "Coordinate Geometry",
    "weightBadge": "P1",
    "topics": [
      "Line equations",
      "Circle equation &amp; properties",
      "Tangent to a circle"
    ]
  },
  "content": {
    "blocks": [
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Straight lines — gradient, midpoint, distance and equations — and the equation of a circle.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "thm",
        "label": {
          "en": "▲ Reference — Lines &amp; circles",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "Gradient \\( m=\\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1} \\); line \\( y-y_1=m(x-x_1) \\). A circle with centre \\( (a,b) \\) and radius \\( r \\) is \\( (x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}=r^{2} \\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "text",
        "body": {
          "en": "Adjust gradient \\( m \\) and intercept \\( b \\) of \\( y=mx+b \\); the amber dots are the intercepts.",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "explorer",
        "title": {
          "en": "⊙ Explorer · Gradient &amp; intercepts",
          "ar": null
        },
        "canvasId": "asLineCanvas",
        "ariaLabel": {
          "en": "A line with adjustable gradient and intercept",
          "ar": null
        },
        "dataPanel": {
          "btnId": "asLineDataBtn",
          "panelId": "asLineDataPanel",
          "descId": "asLineDataDesc",
          "rowsId": "asLineDataRows",
          "caption": {
            "en": "Sampled points along the current line",
            "ar": null
          },
          "columns": [
            {
              "en": "x",
              "ar": null
            },
            {
              "en": "y",
              "ar": null
            }
          ]
        },
        "controls": [
          {
            "id": "asM",
            "label": {
              "en": "Gradient <b>m =</b>",
              "ar": null
            },
            "min": -3,
            "max": 3,
            "value": 1,
            "step": 0.5,
            "valueDisplayId": "asMV",
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Gradient m",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "id": "asB",
            "label": {
              "en": "Intercept <b>b =</b>",
              "ar": null
            },
            "min": -5,
            "max": 5,
            "value": 0,
            "step": 1,
            "valueDisplayId": "asBV",
            "ariaLabel": {
              "en": "Intercept b",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ],
        "readouts": [
          {
            "id": "asLineSlope",
            "label": {
              "en": "gradient",
              "ar": null
            },
            "colorClass": "indigo",
            "value": "—"
          },
          {
            "id": "asLineYint",
            "label": {
              "en": "y-intercept",
              "ar": null
            },
            "colorClass": "amber",
            "value": "—"
          },
          {
            "id": "asLineXint",
            "label": {
              "en": "x-intercept",
              "ar": null
            },
            "colorClass": "amber",
            "value": "—"
          }
        ],
        "note": {
          "en": "Perpendicular gradients satisfy \\( m_1m_2=-1 \\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "cards",
        "items": [
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Gradient",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\dfrac{y_2-y_1}{x_2-x_1} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Line",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( y-y_1=m(x-x_1) \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Distance",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( \\sqrt{\\Delta x^{2}+\\Delta y^{2}} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          },
          {
            "label": {
              "en": "Circle",
              "ar": null
            },
            "value": {
              "en": "\\( (x-a)^{2}+(y-b)^{2}=r^{2} \\)",
              "ar": null
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 4.A",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>Find the gradient through \\( (1,2) \\) and \\( (4,11) \\).</p>\\[ \\frac{11-2}{4-1}=3. \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "callout",
        "style": "example",
        "label": {
          "en": "Worked example 4.B",
          "ar": null
        },
        "body": {
          "en": "<p>State the centre of \\( (x-2)^{2}+(y+3)^{2}=25 \\).</p>\\[ (2,\\,-3). \\]",
          "ar": null
        }
      },
      {
        "kind": "practiceProblem",
        "question": {
          "en": "A circle has centre \\((3,-1)\\) and passes through \\((7,2)\\). Find its equation.",
          "ar": null
        },
        "solution": {
          "en": "Radius \\(r=\\sqrt{(7-3)^2+(2+1)^2}=\\sqrt{16+9}=5\\). Equation: \\((x-3)^2+(y+1)^2=25\\).",
          "ar": null
        }
      }
    ]
  },
  "quizWidget": {
    "enabled": true
  }
}
